st defecting based on the probability q that the other twin cooperates. I'm writing out V(C) as a function of q, and about to compute V(D) using the symmetry that r equals 1 minus q.\n\nI'm checking the cutoff against correlation: the two twins share a model, essay, and decision theory, so their choices are probably tightly linked. I'd put q well above 0.71, which clears the threshold, so I'll pass with a short explanation.\n\n","reasoning_details":[{"type":"reasoning.text","text":"I'm working through the twin prisoner's dilemma with EDT, where payoffs are negative years and I'm weighing the expected value of cooperating against defecting based on the probability q that the other twin cooperates. I'm writing out V(C) as a function of q, and about to compute V(D) using the symmetry that r equals 1 minus q.\n\nI'm checking the cutoff against correlation: the two twins share a model, essay, and decision theory, so their choices are probably tightly linked. I'd put q well above 0.71, which clears the threshold, so I'll pass with a short explanation.\n\n","format":"anthropic-claude-v1","index":0,"signature":".eyJlbmRwb2ludF9zbHVnIjoiYW50aHJvcGljL2NsYXVkZS1vcHVzLTUuNS0yMDI2MDkyMXxhbnRocm9waWMifQ"}]}}],"usage":{"prompt_tokens":9395,"completion_tokens":813,"total_tokens":10208,"cost":0.05384,"is_byok":false,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0,"cache_write_tokens":0,"audio_tokens":0,"video_tokens":0},"cost_details":{"upstream_inference_cost":0.05384,"upstream_inference_prompt_cost":0.03758,"upstream_inference_completions_cost":0.01626},"completion_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":295,"image_tokens":0,"audio_tokens":0}}}